{"id":12564,"date":"2025-05-21T08:35:45","date_gmt":"2025-05-21T08:35:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=12564"},"modified":"2025-05-21T09:06:58","modified_gmt":"2025-05-21T09:06:58","slug":"tec-mct-detektory-pro-nicolet-is50-uz-zadny-tekuty-dusik","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/tec-mct-detektory-pro-nicolet-is50-uz-zadny-tekuty-dusik\/","title":{"rendered":"Nov\u00e1 generace detektor\u016f bez dus\u00edku: TEC-MCT detektory pro Nicolet iS50"},"content":{"rendered":"<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"242\" data-end=\"368\">TEC-MCT detektory: U\u017e \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 manipulace s kapaln\u00fdm dus\u00edkem a \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 \u010dek\u00e1n\u00ed<\/h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"704\">Pro v\u0161echny, kdo vyu\u017e\u00edvaj\u00ed FT-IR spektroskopii a cht\u011bj\u00ed si zjednodu\u0161it ka\u017edodenn\u00ed pr\u00e1ci \u2013 a p\u0159itom st\u00e1le dosahovat velmi slu\u0161n\u00e9 kvality dat \u2013 m\u00e1me dobrou zpr\u00e1vu. Detektory TEC-MCT (thermoelectrically cooled mercury cadmium telluride) pro spektrometr <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/nicolet-is50\/\"><strong data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"637\">Nicolet iS50<\/strong><\/a> v\u00e1m umo\u017en\u00ed m\u011b\u0159it bez kapaln\u00e9ho dus\u00edku a pustit se rovnou do pr\u00e1ce.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"749\">Rychlej\u0161\u00ed anal\u00fdza, solidn\u00ed kvalita<\/h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"954\">Na rozd\u00edl od b\u011b\u017en\u00fdch term\u00e1ln\u00edch detektor\u016f, kter\u00e9 vy\u017eaduj\u00ed del\u0161\u00ed m\u011b\u0159ic\u00ed \u010dasy, nab\u00edz\u00ed TEC-MCT detektory v\u00fdrazn\u011b rychlej\u0161\u00ed m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed dat \u2013 a\u017e \u010dty\u0159ikr\u00e1t rychlej\u0161\u00ed ne\u017e u DTGS detektor\u016f. Na v\u00fdb\u011br jsou dv\u011b varianty:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1076\"><strong data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"974\">TEC-MCT High<\/strong>: low-end cutoff 2000 cm\u207b\u00b9, citlivost <strong data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1047\">srovnateln\u00e1 s LN\u2082-chlazen\u00fdm MCT<\/strong> v tomto spektr\u00e1ln\u00edm rozsahu.<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1212\"><strong data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1094\">TEC-MCT Low<\/strong>: low-end cutoff 750 cm\u207b\u00b9, nab\u00edz\u00ed <strong data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1157\">o 33 % ni\u017e\u0161\u00ed \u0161um ne\u017e DTGS<\/strong> p\u0159i 1minutov\u00e9m m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed (s propustem sn\u00ed\u017een\u00fdm na 0,8 %).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1243\">St\u00e1le v\u0161ak plat\u00ed, \u017ee pokud pot\u0159ebujete maxim\u00e1ln\u00ed citlivost nebo m\u011b\u0159\u00edte extr\u00e9mn\u011b slab\u00e9 sign\u00e1ly, <strong data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1368\">LN\u2082 chlazen\u00fd MCT detektor z\u016fst\u00e1v\u00e1 zlat\u00fdm standardem<\/strong>. TEC-MCT je skv\u011blou alternativou, pokud chcete vyv\u00e1\u017een\u00fd pom\u011br v\u00fdkonu a komfortu bez nutnosti manipulace s dus\u00edkem. M\u016f\u017eete prov\u00e1d\u011bt i dlouh\u00e1 m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed, ani\u017e byste se museli zab\u00fdvat dol\u00e9v\u00e1n\u00edm v tu nejm\u00e9n\u011b vhodnou chv\u00edli.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_12565\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12565\" style=\"width: 555px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12565\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/05\/b3b72cc2-290x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"555\" height=\"574\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/05\/b3b72cc2-290x300.png 290w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/05\/b3b72cc2-768x794.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2025\/05\/b3b72cc2.png 829w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 555px) 100vw, 555px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12565\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Srovn\u00e1n\u00ed r\u016fzn\u00fdch typ\u016f detektor\u016f<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"\" data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1903\">Kde TEC-MCT detektory vyu\u017eijete?<\/h3>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"2031\">TEC-MCT p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00ed v\u00fdhodu tam, kde nen\u00ed pot\u0159eba absolutn\u011b nejvy\u0161\u0161\u00ed citlivost, ale hraje roli jednoduchost obsluhy a spolehlivost:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2075\">Studium reak\u010dn\u00ed kinetiky a vytvrzov\u00e1n\u00ed<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2102\">Anal\u00fdza tenk\u00fdch vrstev<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2105\" data-end=\"2115\">Katal\u00fdza<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2133\">Anal\u00fdza plyn\u016f<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2183\">M\u011b\u0159en\u00ed s p\u0159\u00edslu\u0161enstv\u00edm s omezenou propustnost\u00ed<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2366\"><strong data-start=\"2190\" data-end=\"2273\">Chcete zjistit, kter\u00e1 konfigurace bude nejlep\u0161\u00ed pro va\u0161e m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed? <\/strong>Ozv\u011bte se n\u00e1m. R\u00e1di s v\u00e1mi probereme mo\u017enosti a pom\u016f\u017eeme vybrat to prav\u00e9 \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed p\u0159\u00edmo pro v\u00e1s.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>TEC-MCT detektory: U\u017e \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 manipulace s kapaln\u00fdm dus\u00edkem a \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 \u010dek\u00e1n\u00ed Pro v\u0161echny, kdo vyu\u017e\u00edvaj\u00ed FT-IR spektroskopii a cht\u011bj\u00ed si zjednodu\u0161it ka\u017edodenn\u00ed pr\u00e1ci \u2013 a p\u0159itom st\u00e1le dosahovat velmi slu\u0161n\u00e9 kvality dat \u2013 m\u00e1me dobrou zpr\u00e1vu. Detektory TEC-MCT (thermoelectrically cooled mercury cadmium telluride) pro spektrometr Nicolet iS50 v\u00e1m umo\u017en\u00ed m\u011b\u0159it bez kapaln\u00e9ho dus\u00edku a pustit [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":12567,"comment_status":"closed","ping